{"id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-algebraic-structures.md","title":"Definition — Monoids, Groups and Topological Groups","display":"Definition — Monoids, Groups and Topological Groups","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-algebraic-structures","aliases":["14-df-algebraic-structures"],"display":"Definition — Monoids, Groups and Topological Groups","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-algebraic-structures"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-algebraic-structures</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Monoids, Groups and Topological Groups"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,G\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(M,G\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为候选载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,e,\\iota\">\\(\\mu,e,\\iota\\)</span> 为候选结构数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(G)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(G)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Top}(\\tau,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Top}(\\tau,G)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 的拓扑公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(x,y)\">\\(\\mu(x,y)\\)</span> 简写函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 在有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,y)\">\\((x,y)\\)</span> 上的值；已指定结构后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xy\">\\(xy\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^{-1}\">\\(x^{-1}\\)</span> 分别简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(x,y)\">\\(\\mu(x,y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(x)\">\\(\\iota(x)\\)</span>。下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(G)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(G)\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(M,\\mu,e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mu:M\\times M\\to M\\land e\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in M\\ \\bigl(\\mu(\\mu(x,y),z)=\\mu(x,\\mu(y,z))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in M\\ \\bigl(\\mu(e,x)=x\\land\\mu(x,e)=x\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(M,\\mu,e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mu:M\\times M\\to M\\land e\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in M\\ \\bigl(\\mu(\\mu(x,y),z)=\\mu(x,\\mu(y,z))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in M\\ \\bigl(\\mu(e,x)=x\\land\\mu(x,e)=x\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(G,\\mu,e)\\land\\iota:G\\to G\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in G\\ \\bigl(\\mu(\\iota(x),x)=e\\land\\mu(x,\\iota(x))=e\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(G,\\mu,e)\\land\\iota:G\\to G\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in G\\ \\bigl(\\mu(\\iota(x),x)=e\\land\\mu(x,\\iota(x))=e\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal B\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathcal B\\subseteq\n\\{U\\times V\\mid U,V\\in\\tau\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal B\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathcal B\\subseteq\n\\{U\\times V\\mid U,V\\in\\tau\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsTopologicalGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{Top}(\\tau,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\bigl(\n\\{(x,y)\\in G\\times G\\mid\\mu(x,y)\\in U\\}\\in\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\{x\\in G\\mid\\iota(x)\\in U\\}\\in\\tau\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsTopologicalGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{Top}(\\tau,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\bigl(\n\\{(x,y)\\in G\\times G\\mid\\mu(x,y)\\in U\\}\\in\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\{x\\in G\\mid\\iota(x)\\in U\\}\\in\\tau\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本项补齐原笔记中群作用、幺半群作用和连续离散群作用已经使用、但没有在本书内声明的代数结构前提。拓扑群不额外要求 Hausdorff；后续连续作用的开稳定子判据不需要该条件。新增内容仅限这些既有条目的必要结构依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M,G\\in\\mathcal U$ 为候选载体，$\\mu,e,\\iota$ 为候选结构数据，$\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(G)$。$\\operatorname{Top}(\\tau,G)$ 采用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 的拓扑公理。$\\mu(x,y)$ 简写函数 $\\mu$ 在有序对 $(x,y)$ 上的值；已指定结构后，$xy$、$x^{-1}$ 分别简写 $\\mu(x,y)$、$\\iota(x)$。下式 $\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)$ 对所有 $G\\in\\mathcal U$、$\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(G)$ 定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M,G\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,e,\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Top}(\\tau,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"xy","display":false},{"tex":"x^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(M,\\mu,e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mu:M\\times M\\to M\\land e\\in M\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in M\\ \\bigl(\\mu(\\mu(x,y),z)=\\mu(x,\\mu(y,z))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in M\\ \\bigl(\\mu(e,x)=x\\land\\mu(x,e)=x\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(G,\\mu,e)\\land\\iota:G\\to G\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in G\\ \\bigl(\\mu(\\iota(x),x)=e\\land\\mu(x,\\iota(x))=e\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal B\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathcal B\\subseteq\n\\{U\\times V\\mid U,V\\in\\tau\\}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsTopologicalGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{Top}(\\tau,G)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\bigl(\n\\{(x,y)\\in G\\times G\\mid\\mu(x,y)\\in U\\}\\in\\operatorname{ProdTop}(G,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\{x\\in G\\mid\\iota(x)\\in U\\}\\in\\tau\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2118,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-algebraic-structures|Definition — Monoids, Groups and Topological Groups]]"},{"id":"b15595c6868517ce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathcal U$ 及 $\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G$ 满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsTopologicalGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G)$；$X$ 在本原子中表示右 $G$ 作用的底集且取离散拓扑；$(X,\\rho_X)$ 才是 [[14-df-right-group-actions]] 的作用对象。$\\tau_G$ 为 $G$ 的拓扑。乘积拓扑由矩形基给出。稳定子依赖于当前作用对象，精确记为 $\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)$；$G_x$ 是该参数已绑定时的简称。$BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}$ 为以下定义的满子范畴候选；满子范畴构造见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]"},{"id":"d061a7977fcae989","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathcal U$ 及 $\\mu,e$ 满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(M,\\mu,e)$；$mn:=\\mu(m,n)$。$K=(X,\\rho)$ 为候选作用对象；$|K|=X$、$\\rho_K=\\rho$ 为有序对投影。$b_M$ 提取作用箭头的底层函数。$K,L,H$ 为作用对象，$A\\subseteq|K|$ 为作用稳定子集。下式定义 $BM$ 的六元组、终对象及真值对象；$I\\in\\mathcal I_M$、$m\\in M$。"},{"id":"ff1dddefb4838916","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $G\\in\\mathcal U$ 及 $\\mu,e,\\iota$，满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)$；$gh:=\\mu(g,h)$、$g^{-1}:=\\iota(g)$。作用对象写为 $K=(X,\\rho)$，其中 $X\\in\\mathcal U$、$\\rho:X\\times G\\to X$。$|K|$、$\\rho_K$ 为以下底集、作用投影；$xg$ 简写 $\\rho_K(x,g)$，所在作用对象由 $x$ 的类型决定。箭头严格编码为 $(K,L,f)$，$b_G$ 提取底层集合函数。$K,L,M$ 为作用对象；$O_G,M_G,d_G,c_G,i_G,\\gamma_G$ 为以下范畴数据。$\\mathbf1_G,K\\times_G L$ 为选定终对象和二元积，$\\times$ 在 $BG$ 中简写 $\\times_G$。"},{"id":"d1583fe749649bad","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathcal U$，给定 $\\mu:G^2\\to G$、$e\\in G$、$\\iota:G\\to G$，满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)$；记 $gh=\\mu(g,h)$、$g^{-1}=\\iota(g)$。$BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G$ 见 [[14-df-right-group-actions]]。$\\Delta G$ 为底集 $G$ 取平凡作用的对象；$T$ 为底集 $G$ 取右正则作用的对象。$\\rho_\\Delta,\\rho_T,m_\\Delta,e_\\Delta,\\iota_\\Delta,\\rho,\\nu$ 为下式构造，乘积均为 $BG$ 的所选对角作用积。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-algebraic-structures|Definition — 代数结构与同态]]"}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc","f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0"]}